{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorsMomBcpbyFoHXQeFy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've gone through all ten screens. Here's my answer, then the report.\n\n**What I'd tell a colleague:** It's a list of about 40 things the site knows about but doesn't calculate. Every card says \"לא מחושב\". That includes ETCs, gold funds, corporate bonds, Israel Bonds, dollar deposits and dollar-linked deposits, money-market dollar funds, structured products, REITs, digital portfolios, ביטוח מנהלים, participating life policies and annuity commutation (היוון). The closing section, \"מה האתר לא משווה ולא עושה\", is the one that matters for me. It says they will never do stock picking, trading or derivatives, loans, insurance other than savings policies, ranking by past returns, or physical real estate.\n\nSo for my setup (single stocks traded a few times a month, plus whatever the fx conversion costs me) the site gives me nothing. Even \"עמלת חליפין\" is on the not-calculated list, and so is anything to do with foreign-currency accounts. I'm fairly sure about this. I didn't open the menu tabs to see what it *does* calculate.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- The heading \"מה האתר עוד לא מכסה\" and the red banner. The banner says the laws and rules for all of these are still being checked, and until they're done the site won't calculate them.\n- The card titles and their red \"לא מחושב\" tags, all the way down.\n- A few \"מצב הכיסוי\" sections that were already open (gold fund, insurance fund, dollar deposit). Each one shows the open question blocking it, and says it will appear in the comparison once that question is closed.\n- The bottom list of things the site doesn't do.\n- The footer, which says \"אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\". No broker name anywhere, which is a plus.\n\n**What I skipped:** The \"מה ידוע\" definitions, the law citations and the source dates. I didn't click any \"חוקים וכללים\" chips, and I didn't touch the search.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- **The list doesn't match its heading.** The heading promises \"מוצרים\", products. But many items aren't products:\n  - \"LBMA Gold Price\" is a price benchmark.\n  - \"חברת דירוג\" is a type of company.\n  - \"הסדר חוב\" is an event.\n  - \"עמלת חליפין\" is a fee.\n  - \"מענק\" is a bonus.\n  - \"תיקון 190\" is a change to the law.\n  - \"שיווק השקעות\" is a service.\n  - \"קצבה מוכרת\" and \"תשלומים פטורים\" are tax categories.\n  - \"היוון קצבה מוכרת\" is something you do, not something you buy.\n\n  So I can't treat this list as a reliable inventory of what's missing.\n- **No numbers at all.** Nothing on the page gives me a figure to compare with what I pay now. I'd have closed the tab after the first screen if I weren't checking specifically for gaps.\n- **Two lists that may contradict each other.** The bottom list excludes insurance \"חוץ מפוליסות חיסכון\", but the top list includes ביטוח מנהלים and other insurance items. It's not clear which of these are temporary gaps and which are permanent.\n- **Dense, wall-to-wall cards.** There's no table and no filter, so I had to scroll through everything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3684,"cache_read_input_tokens":19100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3684},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4940513e-2169-4e90-80d6-888d9766341c","uuid":"7e2980bb-eed1-49c2-903f-a26843926887","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:11:26.306Z","request_id":"req_011CgorsMbs9LXPK5dX1xxQ6"}
